# Cryptographic keys / certificates / keystores — never commit.
# gitleaks also flags PEM private-key CONTENT, but ignoring these file types
# prevents them from being staged in the first place. Use `git add -f` for a
# deliberately-public cert/CA bundle.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.crt
*.cer
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*


